Hello AlDiom,

lavaan gives a hint for the problem:

  lavaan NOTE: this may be a symptom that the model is not identified.

Regarding your Minimum Function Test Statistics / df, which are well above 2, your significant chi-square p-value and your complex model, the model is likely to do not fit well enough. Mabe you have a look at the fit-measures (CFI, TLI) to be sure. Modification indices may guide you to a proper fit, before starting bootstrap.

Best
Stephan

